       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. REF-MOD-DEMO.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 DATE-TEXT   PIC X(10) VALUE "2024-05-17".
       01 YEAR-PART   PIC X(4).
       01 MONTH-PART  PIC X(2).
       01 DAY-PART    PIC X(2).
       01 BUFFER      PIC X(12) VALUE ALL "-".

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           MOVE DATE-TEXT(1:4) TO YEAR-PART
           MOVE DATE-TEXT(6:2) TO MONTH-PART
           MOVE DATE-TEXT(9:2) TO DAY-PART
           DISPLAY "YEAR:  " YEAR-PART
           DISPLAY "MONTH: " MONTH-PART
           DISPLAY "DAY:   " DAY-PART
           MOVE "COBOL" TO BUFFER(4:5)
           DISPLAY "BUFFER: " BUFFER
           DISPLAY "LAST CHAR: " DATE-TEXT(10:)
           STOP RUN.
